         summary     = 'Render C source, parsed with lang/c-hilit, as a syntax highlighted web page.'
         description = 'Render C source, parsed with lang/c-hilit, as a syntax highlighted web page.
                        Fredrik Öhrström (c) 2026 spdx: MIT

                          xmq ixml:lang/c-hilit foo.c xsl:lang/c-hilit-to-html to-html > foo.html

                        The page follows the light/dark preference of the browser, like ixml2html. The title
                        can be set with --stringparam=title=foo.c (transform with a file) and the elements
                        are spans with a class, eg <span class="keyword">return</span>.')
