                        direction it blows from, the variation is drawn as an arc. Every weather group
                        gets an icon with cloud, sun, rain, snow, ice, lightning and fog. The cloud
                        layers are drawn from the highest to the lowest with the oktas as puffs.
                        Everything is also printed in words in the table below.

                        The groups after a trend (BECMG, TEMPO) are the forecast, they are not drawn
                        but printed with the trend.')
